{
  "schema": 1,
  "library": "KomorebiPolynomial",
  "scope": "Finite polynomial coefficient packets over semirings; an actual rational falling-factorial linear equivalence and transported projectors/product; exact complex roots-of-unity averaging and rational-coordinate compatibility. Counts are declaration inventories, including helpers and explicit counterexamples. No infinite-series, analytic, concrete finite-difference, or numerical implementation claim.",
